 main stream narrative. During covid, she showed that the virus and vaccine caused a depletion of our bifidobacteria, which warranted further study. Additionally, she had the GUTSTOTREAT and took the sickest people amongst us and got them out alive. Every Single Patient.\n\nDuring the episode we discuss how she is still dealing with nefarious forces, like investment firms that back journals to ensure that they can control the narrative about which treatments work. She tells me how physicians no longer want to peer review articles because they are unpaid and not listened to. And we discuss her research around fecal transplant and it's potential for Parkinson's, Alzheimer's, and autism.\n\nWe should be listening to smart people like Dr. Hazan who have dedicated their life to doing what's right. SOME DAY WE WILL BE THE PATIENT and we better hope that the treatments have been developed to give us more time.\n\nLet's talk some shit, Giddy up! \n\n@SabinehazanMD", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '3464917999', 'name': 'sabine hazan md', 'screen_name': 'SabinehazanMD', 'indices': [1196, 1210]}]}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 16, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Tue Jan 28 16:47:45 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1884282227338477773', 'display_text_range': [0, 278], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/qqT7YuSePa', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/StephenIvanoski/status/1884282227338477773/video/1', 'id_str': '1884276200299700224', 'indices': [279, 302], 'media_key': '13_1884276200299700224', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/1884276200299700224/img/FubbDLKAAcKBr55S.jpg', 'type': 'video', 'url': 'https://t.co/qqT7YuSePa', 'additional_media_info': {'monetizable': False}, 'ext_media_availability': {'status': 'Available'}, 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 720, 'w': 1280, 'resize': 'fi